f(first,{one:1,two:2,three:3});---------- Options ----------
{"printWidth":20}
---------- Output ----------
f(first, {
  one: 1,
  two: 2,
  three: 3,
});

---------- Options ----------
{"printWidth":20,"semi":false}
---------- Output ----------
